bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    native_build_llc_probe_per_unit_transient_not_found_2026-11-16, 0, "native-build --backend llvm emitted 1427 x llc not found with llc on PATH when transient --version probe misses exhausted _FIND_TOOL_MAX_MISSES=3 and permanently cached empty string without diagnostics. Fixed in src/compiler/95.interp/interpreter/llvm/tools.spl (_FIND_TOOL_MAX_TRANSIENT_MISSES=16, spinlock protection, transient_array_scope_state_v1 persistence guard, SIMPLE_LLVM_MINGW_ROOT/bin, last_tool_probe_diagnostic, tool_probe_diagnostic_for_candidates) and src/compiler/70.backend/backend/llvm_backend_tools.spl (single-probe _llvm_resolve_object_tools_v1, llvm_combine_tool_probe_diagnostics_v1, llvm_llc_not_found_message_v1). waiting-for: full native-build verification under Phase 2 compiler load."

